{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo takes you through the introductory portion of Apollo Cosmic, allowing you to hear from each of the characters who guide the Thomas M. Stafford, the player, through the game. Players will get to explore three different areas and find limited objects that serve as keys / evidence of events that happened in Tom's life, real or imaged.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apollo Cosmic is a first person psychological horror / walking simulator that takes the player on an awakening journey through the mind of Thomas M. Stafford. Players will control Tom to explore the far side of the moon, look for and collects objects that may unlock new paths forward, and hear from an unwelcome tour guide who wants Tom to follow the &quot;right&quot; path...</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3966770?t=1756468110","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966770/57fe3215bffd97fab0fa8e0cdb7aefa2c66dc7de/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1756468110","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966770/0823a219fe7d9cc7bd3f66c83bdec3a812b2726f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1756468110","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3966770/0823a219fe7d9cc7bd3f66c83bdec3a812b2726f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1756468110","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Game demo","id":10}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The demo takes you through the introductory portion of Apollo Cosmic, allowing you to hear from each of the characters who guide the Thomas M. Stafford, the player, through the game. Players will get to explore three different areas and find limited objects that serve as keys / evidence of events that happened in Tom's life, real or imaged.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Apollo Cosmic is a first